### Attendance requests (phase 5): the teacher's routes. Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the IntelliJ
### HTTP client. Needs the TEACHER role. The taps that create the data are in demo.http (run its steps 1 to 10 first).
@host = https://tarjepafi-api-pafi7k2.azurewebsites.net
# @host = http://localhost:8080

### 0. Sign in as the demo teacher (D0001)
# @name signIn
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "docente@upc.edu.pe", "password": "Docente123*" }

###
@token = {{signIn.response.body.$.token}}

### 1. My classes of the day (default today by the campus clock), with attendance counts
GET {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/mine?date=2026-10-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. One class with its roster (404 SESSION_NOT_FOUND, 403 NOT_YOUR_SESSION for someone else's)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/ses-02-7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Poll the records of the session: first call, then `after=<nextCursor>` of the previous answer
GET {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/ses-02-7/attendance?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/ses-02-7/attendance?after=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Confirm the PENDING marks left (409 SESSION_NOT_STARTED while SCHEDULED, 409 NOTHING_TO_CONFIRM)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/ses-02-7/confirm-pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Edit a student's mark with a reason (rule 6.E). 400 for a blank reason, 422 STUDENT_NOT_ENROLLED
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/ses-02-7/attendance/ch-u202310822
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PRESENT", "reason": "El lector no registro su tarjeta" }

### 6. Justify an absence
POST {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/ses-02-7/attendance/ch-u202311233/justify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Certificado medico" }

### 7. My own marks in my classes (arrival, departure, duration)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/attendance/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Meetings and trainings I am invited to
GET {{host}}/api/v1/class-sessions/meetings/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. The admin cannot use these routes: 403 (sign in as admin and send the same request)
